    {
      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:march_table",
      "text": [
        "A camp should feel lived in. These pieces are made from March wood, stone, reed and leaves. They do nothing but look good, and need no Pulse."
      ],
      "title": "Camp furniture"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "The pieces",
      "text": [
        "- **March Table** and **March Stool**: face you when placed.",
        "- **Spirit Urn**: a stone pot for a shelf or a corner.",
        "- **Woven Mat**: a thin rug that needs a sturdy floor under it.",
        "- **Wall Shelf**: hangs on the side of a sturdy block and drops if the wall goes.",
        "For hanging decorations, see the Wind Charm."
      ]
    },
